{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcd9033b4afa8a50365a58cb6a49d6feefdf5dccf754d125a2de80db61edd134",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf0e12e38af7e3393332f4dd06b7b7fec03640530fd2366c21fd2674f5ab964e",
      "text": "噢，●●●●プロデューサー？辛苦啦！\n终于明天就要录制了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7689d4416f45545e74e151b7c88bf669564b42e1e2f730855fb68d142a3801a",
      "text": "我现在就兴奋起来了。\n因为能展现截至今天为止的练习成果了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f8bb065c0fa0f198a6df98678a5a8f1dc63f8c1464c77b3ce86b9aa7a28bd25",
      "text": "为了我要挑战的空气曲棍球，\n大家还一起自制了球台呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ff2508eac169439e8ad5e4cae23718847e6008b317074ae3fce89e28de3d039",
      "text": "多亏了山下先生的图纸，就算是瓦楞纸做的，\n也成了一台像模像样的曲棍球台哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a4f77ca767083384f2b0be46776c9d1d631526d96cdd1e35eba50a6bff04a71",
      "text": "不光是我，每个人都动脑筋\n为了比赛反复练习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60f3b220aa08f4ceca3d5fae6fb3d524ef06021198de6288916475c8a122b623",
      "text": "全员都是为了明天而努力过来的，\n绝对会赢给你们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a993b100c15aba94b31f748aedff34c63fc77bcc3faff26a8dedaf036ff4efe",
      "text": "我会为您加油的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c865c79cd5607579698623373915040c04f27fc714f32b394c59fac31fa3c739",
      "text": "目标全胜吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42679182ee696cf36e2e499873c717e39663301921dcc5b647bdf2f403c667e8",
      "text": "噢！期待我们的活跃表现吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_307_2_3_001_07_09_a:2_3_001_07_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:781d3ea29691ebd1f7fd5a161284df76f029fffebec07fe08133d9c5d9869d37",
      "text": "那就等着听好消息吧。\n我会全力以赴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
